{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "62c1083263f2f82abeea0e4c82bf1df0139a7ac453e8be33bcec9ec38df5e35b", "ja": "もぐもぐ……。\nん～、おいし～♪", "zh": "（嚼嚼）……\n嗯～好好吃～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1001_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a4e4ceeff5c30891f5ebbb82f01cee22e76df0bd7af7b764bb7a1e7797c58063", "ja": "おはようございます、青羽さん。\n……ん？　今食べてるそれって……。", "zh": "早安，青羽小姐。\n……嗯？你在吃的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "dcb6b4fa8cb100ddd6b04660f20d442cae374bc0f466357144658922a4de4711", "ja": "はい、駄菓子です♪　さっき懐かしミュージアムに\n行って、いろいろお菓子を買ってきちゃって。", "zh": "嗯，是零嘴♪我去了趟怀旧博物馆，\n买了一些零嘴回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "201fa5f6bbd2b4a9b729b492ccbae3c279ae0d54bd4597281a0354257e8f516a", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんとみんなへの\nお土産も、たくさん買ってきたんですよ♪", "zh": "不过我也有买很多伴手礼回来，\n要给{$P$}先生和大家喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "320eae81b9999ec82afa234764f0e2d62c80038d06d8b9e65897f6ad081fe5ac", "ja": "お土産ですか、ありがとうございます！\n駄菓子なんて、懐かしいな。", "zh": "有伴手礼啊，谢谢你！\n这些零嘴真令人怀念啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "b209b559c0754a717ec673eb5092b523fc8c56df92a3e818973894b53ff27ad2", "ja": "そうですよね～。\nあっ、それと、社長さんから伝言です！", "zh": "就是说啊～\n啊，还有啊，社长有托我向你转达！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "993b366e4cf7be4ba2e524152f8322fa68123295f5ba058bfd6bdb01bbed0b5d", "ja": "大切なお話があるから、\nまた事務所に来てほしい、って。", "zh": "他说有重要的事要跟你说，\n所以想要你再去一趟事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "460a4e293f09a148c6864f3e1f869de76192d075c6b4e7948767745227ffac3b", "ja": "そうですか、わかりました。\nちょっと行ってきますね。", "zh": "这样啊，我知道了。\n那我过去一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "2cda5f73386dca0b11ebeb43454738afd509a6915f514a6e091c7027a49bf7c9", "ja": "あっ、あの、社長さんと音無先輩の分のお土産、\n届けてもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "啊，对了，这是要给社长和音无前辈他们的伴手礼，\n你可以帮我拿过去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1010", "source_sha256": "a33967b3fe4d92e08113bb6ad7b15b47c8ffb5fa8f47144c1b5e5c56e5d51720", "ja": "もちろん", "zh": "当然可以", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "77ee6426d062f8a875a159a0049bdae61d4e4b313de9b2b8a5168f354e193cd6", "ja": "もちろんです。\n社長達も、きっと喜んでくれますよ。", "zh": "当然好啊。\n社长他们收到伴手礼，一定也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "e4338702b6ea0e62aecdd5c2500722aecb78c8e4bafd5d2ad60ef7ec0dd90c11", "ja": "そうだといいなぁ。\nそれじゃ、行ってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "我也希望如此。\n那么，请慢走～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9e6fba2d683f6edc2c3550c8d721ecb85015808073d2a4c0fd948f027b612288", "ja": "おはようございます。\nこれ、青羽さんのお土産です。", "zh": "早安。\n这是青羽小姐给的伴手礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "b70beacff43fc099a47a0069ba82db0538d7dd1e9e5d82e2379f00519c48433d", "ja": "おお、駄菓子か。いやあ、懐かしい。\n後で、青羽君に礼を言わないとね。", "zh": "哦哦，是零嘴啊。哎呀，真令人怀念。\n我之后得再跟青羽道谢一下呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "142f16035c087d9e6860ca5f6765b3e21a4823dfc17222f3c02515e75bff4ba9", "ja": "わぁ、このお菓子、まだ売ってたんだ！\nふふっ、昔はみんな食べてましたよね♪", "zh": "哇，原来这种零嘴还有在卖啊！\n呵呵，以前常跟大家一起吃呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "f98566af794e6e1985096c04d8c0c50cb3f958208d77d717e792a5857ae83ba7", "ja": "……はっ。今、ナチュラルに昔って言っちゃった！\n今のは聞かなかったことにしてくださいっ！", "zh": "……啊，不小心脱口而出「以前」这种话了！\n麻烦请当作没听到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "84e0df35b9e4261d1439a0e09546d89d13bc3c3b1b0aaf236f21e292ce57ec66", "ja": "いいですけど……子どもの頃のことは、\nべつに昔でもいいような……？", "zh": "是可以啦……\n但把小时候的事说成「以前」也没错吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "8576fd9379bbaa9379e65c1b970594dbbad024ebf2a33e30a85b83d955cdaff1", "ja": "ダメですっ！　昔のことを昔って認めちゃうと、\nなんというか、ダメージを受けてしまうんです！", "zh": "不行！要是承认以前的事真的是很久以前了，\n该怎么说呢，我会大受打击啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3058b6b0d84130675448bf710cdfc8b597628a6c627eb41d18e255a40a81a1ea", "ja": "そ、そうですか、わかりました。\nただ……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗，我知道了。\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "716a248b65ffbba3bef9f3cc43f50c8cdd4768d5d1002039e8503e4a41bb9ec2", "ja": "音無さんは、まだまだこれからじゃないですか。\nそんなに気にしなくていいと思いますよ。", "zh": "音无小姐未来的路还很长啊，\n我认为你不需要那么在意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "5b122ec02c5727c08e6bc7638345fb8901456bb50a69b664a8cde41ea5ad2d1d", "ja": "{$P$}さん……！\nうう、なんて優しいピヨ……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……！\n呜呜，你真温柔啾……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "22d2d307de0c6485ce643e3089f1d52e3a5d5b14a1b912e40558f59d70a33143", "ja": "ところで、社長。\n話というのは？", "zh": "话说回来，社长。\n请问找我是有什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "bf823456494e8d7b19a4a331d2344b320b49134822212846583dc63f8ddade92", "ja": "うむ、実はね。またそろそろ、新しいユニットを\n結成して欲しいと思ってるんだよ。", "zh": "嗯，其实啊，\n我正考虑再请你帮忙组成新的团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6e80114ae3b3dbb1d2922e79790e7b78ad4cc97ba4fcca8babc554adb1402c93", "ja": "そうでしたか！　今のところ、新しいアイディアは\n浮かんでないんですが、社長に何かお考えが？", "zh": "是这样啊！目前我是还没有什么新的点子，\n社长你有什么想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "f00a25a3d340e60ecb8da8059649f8a27459654386b12c67dbfeeb3d9ec55593", "ja": "いやあ、それがさっぱりでね！\n実に困ったものだ。はっはっはっはっは！", "zh": "唉，其实我完全想不到啊！\n真是伤脑筋，哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "cbe8131989c43cad8457fcddde1204807c914ba9b0c7f41dc1b2cca7b41e81c4", "ja": "というわけで、すべてを君に任せたいと思う。\nどうだね、やってくれるかね？", "zh": "就是这样，我打算全权交给你处理。\n怎么样，你愿意接下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_1027", "source_sha256": "14835a1984637ea25b7c754d13397c848a8c0b5d154736cb397b119a54faa631", "ja": "それならそれで！", "zh": "那就这么办吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9c914b0d1292ede79687a9269b21f2c43cb0e6246f1611f8f72023a7e9cc7d64", "ja": "わかりました。それならそれで、ゼロから考える\nまでです。やりがいがあります！", "zh": "我明白了，那就这么办吧。\n可以从零开始想点子，我认为很值得尝试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "f6073f8ba34009dc3f772776dc070a64048a2c8b0523f911cc76c8a768a17b5f", "ja": "うむ、君ならばそう言ってくれると思っていた。\n楽しみにしているからね！", "zh": "嗯，我就知道你会这么说。\n我很拭目以待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "552ddcbc157350c4eda3406f69637b175d2d68779e74b18d2c0a33e316e0b885", "ja": "ところで、駄菓子といえば駄菓子屋を思い出すよ。\n私が子供の頃はコンビニなんてなかったからね。", "zh": "对了，说到零嘴我就想起零嘴店了。\n毕竟我小的时候还没有便利商店嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_2003_president", "source_sha256": "4b42d81d0a5dfbfa321c72bafb24cd60f66c218cc6a3969d81f948ac080e99c2", "ja": "いつも駄菓子屋に通っては、\nアメリカンクラッカーで遊んだものだ。", "zh": "我以前每次去零嘴店，\n都会玩碰碰球。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "f569ce60e783d15d15a4303c370a4b698acb89174c544b15f9c03cdec5e2562d", "ja": "ふふっ。社長にも子どものころがあったんですね♪", "zh": "呵呵，社长也是有童年时期呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_2005_president", "source_sha256": "a62faa516cb61b357484cb668c0bf37a9d746de153318f19922b82dc97f5de0b", "ja": "もちろんだとも。あの頃はあの頃で、いい時代だった。\n……もちろん、今も楽しいがね！", "zh": "那当然啊，说起来那段时日也是个好年代。\n……当然现在我也过得很开心啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0074_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0074_story_intro_2006_p", "source_sha256": "109b725ae54b4723083ef8bda6a500c6c841b5b5c65c6a08a790025d7937a9bb", "ja": "（新しいユニットは、時代を超えて愛される存在に\nしたいな。よし、まずは戻って考えよう！）", "zh": "（真希望能把新团体打造成即使时代更迭\n仍然备受喜爱的存在。好，我先回去想想看吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
